Title: Longitudinal analysis of tyrosine kinase inhibitor therapy outcomes and BCR-ABL1 transcript decline velocity in chronic myeloid leukemia: A 16-year real-world study.
Abstract: No large, randomized trials have compared three or more tyrosine kinase inhibitors (TKIs) in a single chronic myeloid leukemia (CML) cohort. Most studies are two-arm comparisons versus imatinib, or rely on indirect methods.

